+-- wasm64 port: Mathlib renamed this lemma to `Finset.sum_eq_sum_sdiff_singleton_add` (2026-06-03) and the
+-- old additive name no longer exists; keep the name the game teaches as an alias of the same statement.
+alias _root_.Finset.sum_eq_sum_diff_singleton_add := Finset.sum_eq_sum_sdiff_singleton_add
+
 /--
 If you have some set s, where you know `h : i ∈ s`, then `sum_eq_sum_diff_singleton_add h` is a proof that
 `(Finset.sum s fun x => f x) = (Finset.sum (s \ {i}) fun x => f x) + f i`
